      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "VANDAROSS (4) stalked the pace then went home a little too well to collect his maiden win last start over this distance at Gawler. Big step up in grade today but he is progressing in good style this prep. Worth following on the eight-day back-up. CZECH OUT (1) is as honest as they come. Shouldered 60kgs last time out but was too strong in a BM66 over this course and distance. This looks no harder so from the inside gate he gets every chance to add to his burgeoning record. REBEL TUESDAY (3) appreciated the drop in grade when beaten just 0.7 lengths by CZECH OUT here at this trip a fortnight ago. Meets him 2.5kgs better which could easily see the result reversed. INHABIT (7) led for the judge but couldn't hold out CZECH OUT and REBEL TUESDAY here last time. Genuine filly who will give backers a great sight. FAST FOOD (5) clocked in fourth in the CZECH OUT race after showing pace. Has only raced twice so he has more improvement to come than the key rivals.",
